WEBVTT

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:12.710
Wealth, fame, and power.

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:18.600
There once was a man who obtained it all-
The Pirate King, Gold Roger.

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:25.020
His last words at the execution stand sent people from all over the world out to sea.

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:27.740
My wealth and treasure?

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:29.620
It can be yours if you want it!

00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:31.240
Search for it!

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:33.990
I left everything in that one place.

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:41.370
Men now set sail for the Grand Line in search of romance.

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:46.110
The world has entered a Great Age of Pirates!

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:02.350
I'm so sorry.  This is all because I didn't pay attention.

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:06.390
It's hopeless... I feel faint...

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:12.650
Nami-san, hang in there...
And Robin-chan, are you all right?

00:01:16.670 --> 00:01:19.820
I never would've thought that this could happen.

00:01:20.870 --> 00:01:25.750
This won't be very funny if it leads to the whole crew dying.

00:01:26.910 --> 00:01:32.090
I doubted my eyes when I saw what he had done...

00:01:32.090 --> 00:01:34.760
Ah!  Though I have no eyes.

00:01:35.630 --> 00:01:40.690
That's all in the past now.
Whining about it won't get us anywhere.

00:01:42.770 --> 00:01:46.640
For now, we just need to preserve our strength.

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:51.020
We can't even move right now, so we'll just have to believe...

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:52.900
in our Captain.

00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:56.770
We're counting on you, Luffy.

00:02:02.090 --> 00:02:03.280
<i>I'm worried...</i>

00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:29.020
I see a town!

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:30.950
Time to go ashore, men!

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:32.060
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:36.630
Boss, we're almost ready to go ashore.

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:37.860
I see.

00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:40.420
I'm ready for some action!

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:45.400
We'll show those people just how terrifying we are.

00:02:46.490 --> 00:02:48.330
Every last one of them!

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:05.930
W-W-What's going on?!

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:09.420
That is one big ship!

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:10.810
Is it a pirate ship?

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:13.380
Oh, I know!

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:44.590
A ship?

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:47.390
The ocean liner isn't supposed to arrive today, right?

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:49.810
That mark!

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:54.270
<i>We're under attack!</i>

00:03:58.940 --> 00:04:01.900
<i>Pirates are coming!</i>

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:04.030
N-No way!

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:07.370
<i>Run!</i>

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:11.450
<i>Take refuge in the town center!</i>

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:23.220
<i>Hurry and get to safety!</i>

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:25.590
<i>We're under attack by pirates!</i>

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:26.810
Pirates?!

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:33.030
I won't let the pirates have their way!

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:35.770
I'll protect my treasure, even if it kills me!

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:51.380
I won't let anyone take it!

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:55.210
I'll chase those pirates away!

00:04:57.010 --> 00:05:00.090
No doubt about it.
That's Gally of the Crescent Moon's ship!

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:06.160
Gally... I heard he recently got a bounty on his head.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:09.580
If he attacks this small town, there'll be nothing left of it!

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:11.160
Why don't we try to negotiate with him?

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:14.850
But... if we give him the money we've saved up... even if it is to protect the town...

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:17.960
But trying to fight him would be far too reckless!

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:22.010
What should we do, Mayor?!

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:27.360
We just have to fight them!

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:28.990
Silk?!

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:32.830
There's no need for concern.
We can just drive those pirates away!

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:36.580
<i>You be quiet!</i>

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:38.500
Don't say it in unison!

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:41.050
I live in this town too, you know!

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:44.390
Why should we let the pirates trample all over us?!

00:05:44.390 --> 00:05:45.800
We have to stand up to them sooner or later!

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:48.300
Please, just stay out of this!

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:52.180
Whenever you get involved, even the most trivial situations turn into disasters!

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:56.640
Go to the town center.

00:05:58.440 --> 00:05:59.250
Huh?!  Why?!

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:01.000
Anyway, I'll try talking to them.
Huh?!  Why?!

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.360
Anyway, I'll try talking to them.

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:06.020
A few of you should stay here, but the rest should head for the town center.

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:10.110
I'm sorry!

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:13.200
Is that Gally of the Crescent Moon?

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:17.000
I thought "Crescent Moon" referred to the shape of his mustache.

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:20.540
Huh, I expected someone more muscular.

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:24.100
It must be because of his hat! It looks like a crescent moon!

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:24.880
I see...

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:29.130
Why is there only one?

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:33.850
Aw, man... I couldn't get any food after all.

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:36.600
Well, there must be a café here somewhere.

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:38.810
I'll just go get something to eat while I'm here.

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:42.350
I won't let you get away with this!

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:45.050
Who the hell do you think I am?!

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:49.070
I'm the great Gally of the Crescent Moon!

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:52.330
I only dropped my guard for a second!  That's why I lost!

00:06:52.330 --> 00:06:55.290
No wait!  Like hell would I ever lose, dumbass!

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:58.580
I was just wondering if you'd share some of your food!

00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:01.420
Besides, you're the one who attacked me!

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:02.790
As soon as I said your mustache looked weird...

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:04.020
<i>Whaddaya mean, weird?!</i>

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:05.460
You're totally picking a fight with me!

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:10.010
Too bad you picked the wrong opponent.

00:07:10.470 --> 00:07:13.460
You've angered the last man in the world you'd want as your enemy...

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:15.720
Me, the great Gally-sama-

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:16.430
<i>What?!</i>

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:17.970
He already left.

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:19.860
<i>Oh, really?!</i>

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:21.020
I'm gonna kill him.

00:07:21.020 --> 00:07:24.270
Why isn't he making any demands?

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:27.630
<i>Café!</i>

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:28.530
<i>Huh?!</i>

00:07:31.490 --> 00:07:34.560
Hang in there!  Who did this to you?!

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:37.360
I-It was Silk again...

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:40.620
She ran off again?

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:42.620
But I can't believe he'd hurt one of the townsfolk.  You'll pay for this, pirate!

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:44.750
Sniff, sniff...
But I can't believe he'd hurt one of the townsfolk.  You'll pay for this, pirate!

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:45.160
Sniff, sniff...

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:48.540
It's a café!

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:51.710
Excuse me!

00:07:51.710 --> 00:07:52.800
There you are!

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:55.680
I've been looking for you!

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:57.050
W-Who are you?

00:07:57.550 --> 00:08:01.730
Prepare yourself, Gally of the Crescent Moon!

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:11.110
Right!  I'm sure that must have scared him!

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:18.160
<i>I cut his head off!</i>

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:22.580
<i>W-What should I do?!  I only wanted to scare him!</i>

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:29.220
What was that, all of a sudden?!  That's dangerous, you know!

00:08:29.220 --> 00:08:30.720
<i>Monster!</i>

00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:32.580
That's rude!

00:08:32.580 --> 00:08:34.590
You're Gally of the Crescent Moon, aren't you?!

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:36.840
Who's that?

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:39.050
I got the wrong man?

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:41.550
But weren't you on that ship?

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:43.400
Oh, that?

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:44.810
Who are you?

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:49.230
I'm Monkey D. Luffy.  A pirate.

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:50.150
A pirate?!

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:53.610
Get out of this town!  I'll protect my treasure!

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:55.200
Treasure?

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:57.420
You came here to plunder us, didn't you?!

00:08:57.420 --> 00:08:59.620
No I didn't.

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:04.130
I got separated from my crew, then ended up in this town by coincidence.

00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:05.710
You're not part of Gally's crew?

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:07.240
No, I'm not.

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:09.880
Who are you, exactly?

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:12.380
What?!

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:16.180
<i>My hat!  My hat got cut!</i>

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:20.550
Hey!  Look what you've done to my treasure!

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:25.520
T-Treasure?  That straw hat is your treasure?

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:33.320
I'm sorry about what happened earlier.

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:35.350
I cut your treasure...

00:09:35.350 --> 00:09:39.280
It's fine, really.  You fixed it up, after all.

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:43.410
Anyway, sorry about eating your food like this...

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:46.930
Don't let it bother you.

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:51.880
Still, how funny.  Your treasure being a hat...

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:54.720
You think?

00:09:56.730 --> 00:10:01.890
I got this straw hat from Shanks.  It means a lot to me.

00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:05.600
You mean Red Haired Shanks, the great pirate?!

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:08.310
Yeah.  I made a pledge on this hat,

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:11.690
to gather up a crew and become a pirate.

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:18.740
Are you really just a pirate?

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:21.360
A completely normal pirate.

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:25.270
I'm searching for the great treasure, One Piece.

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:29.460
Oh, but I guess I won't really be normal any more once I become the Pirate King.

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:38.300
I'm the daughter of a pirate.

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:41.970
A pirate's abandoned child.

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:43.760
Really?

00:10:45.430 --> 00:10:50.100
Pirates often target this place.  It's been this way for a long time.

00:10:50.590 --> 00:10:56.020
Fifteen years ago, a pirate crew attacked this town and abandoned a child here.

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:57.480
That child was me.

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:09.620
We can't... survive like this...

00:11:10.540 --> 00:11:12.620
What should we do?!

00:11:22.470 --> 00:11:24.120
Really...

00:11:24.820 --> 00:11:26.930
She has no idea how we feel...

00:11:32.770 --> 00:11:34.400
Yeah...

00:11:35.690 --> 00:11:38.900
We can't just stay depressed forever!

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:41.360
We have to protect this child.

00:11:43.980 --> 00:11:45.870
All of us!

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:53.100
I am the child of a pirate who destroyed this town.

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:54.530
You'd think they'd bear a grudge against me,

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:57.420
or that they'd feel no duty to look after me,

00:11:57.420 --> 00:12:02.130
but the townsfolk didn't care about that, and raised me to become who I am today.

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:06.010
That's why... this town is my treasure!

00:12:08.220 --> 00:12:09.350
Do you understand?!

00:12:10.470 --> 00:12:15.350
I don't want to see the kind-hearted people of this town cry!

00:12:15.350 --> 00:12:20.480
They're all so important to me, that I'll fight for them even if I'm alone!

00:12:20.480 --> 00:12:22.020
Thanks for the food...

00:12:22.020 --> 00:12:23.450
<i>Listen when people are talking to you!</i>

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:24.770
Gally?

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:25.760
That's right.

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:28.330
You've got a really weird name!

00:12:28.820 --> 00:12:31.750
My name is Silk!  Gally is the pirate!

00:12:32.340 --> 00:12:33.710
Is he really not here?

00:12:33.710 --> 00:12:37.040
You little insect collector!  I won't stand for this!

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:41.880
My name is weird?!  Not even my parents ever told me such a thing!

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:45.720
You've got some nerve mocking me, the great Gally-sama!

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:48.330
That's Gally of the Crescent Moon?!

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:49.930
So he managed to untie his ropes...

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:54.770
After I kill this guy, I'm gonna take every last bit of this town's money!

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:56.990
Damn, he really pisses me off!  I swear I'm gonna kill 'im!

00:12:56.990 --> 00:12:57.980
Get out of my sight!

00:12:57.980 --> 00:13:02.060
What did you do to make him so mad at you?!

00:13:02.060 --> 00:13:05.140
He attacked me first!  I just said his mustache looked weird.

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:07.570
You said it again!

00:13:09.610 --> 00:13:11.280
Punish him!

00:13:11.280 --> 00:13:13.410
You're in the way.  Move.

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:24.800
You're the one who came at me first!

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:47.700
Amazing!  He was this strong all along?!

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:55.110
Damn it...

00:13:57.460 --> 00:13:58.500
<i>What the-?!</i>

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:10.430
You little runt!  Don't get too cocky!

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:13.130
You cowards!

00:14:13.130 --> 00:14:14.720
Yeah, what about it?

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:17.140
If you value her life, don't move!

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:19.190
Move even an inch, and we'll shoot her!

00:14:20.850 --> 00:14:21.480
Die!

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:25.110
Why, you...

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:29.150
S-Stop it!  Don't you care what happens to her?

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:32.030
I-I'm gonna shoot her!

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:34.240
Fire!

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:46.170
No way!  His arm stretched out!

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:47.670
A Devil Fruit user?!

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:57.850
How's that?!

00:14:58.970 --> 00:15:00.140
This is no time to be surprised!

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:00.890
Click!

00:15:14.860 --> 00:15:17.120
That's what happens when you get too cocky, you little brat!

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:22.580
<i>No way!</i>

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:27.210
That won't work on me.  'Cause I'm made of rubber.

00:15:29.590 --> 00:15:30.430
You're kidding...

00:15:30.430 --> 00:15:31.380
<i>Shock!</i>

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:39.580
Man, that was a surprise...

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:42.600
P-Pistols don't work on you?!

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:44.440
What's going on here?!

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:47.610
I ate the Gum Gum Fruit.

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:52.130
So my entire body is made of rubber.

00:15:53.150 --> 00:15:54.570
Pretty cool, huh?

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:58.910
I gained this ability in exchange for never being able to swim again.

00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:01.120
Y-You're a rubber man?!

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:07.380
Damn you!  We'll remember this!

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:15.480
Here.

00:16:18.300 --> 00:16:19.900
You're not hurt, are you?

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:22.530
I-I'm fine... Thank you...

00:16:22.530 --> 00:16:26.400
Oh, the Mini Merry is still on their ship!

00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:28.730
I have to get it back... Gotta hurry!

00:16:39.150 --> 00:16:41.590
That's one cool hairstyle, old guy!

00:16:41.590 --> 00:16:43.710
It looks like the Merry's Flying Model!

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:47.130
You're a pirate, right?

00:16:47.130 --> 00:16:49.290
Yup!  I sure am!

00:16:53.260 --> 00:16:56.590
<i>Charge!</i>

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:14.820
Now the town is safe!

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:16.960
You got careless, Gally!

00:17:16.960 --> 00:17:18.530
You've got the wrong guy!

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:22.080
Don't talk back to us!
Consider your situation!

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:24.040
I'm telling you, I'm not Gally!

00:17:26.110 --> 00:17:27.020
Silk!

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:28.420
Mayor!  Everyone!

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:30.460
That's not Gally!

00:17:31.270 --> 00:17:33.380
That's right!

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:34.510
I was too late!

00:17:34.510 --> 00:17:36.590
Well done, you puny insects!

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:39.370
I am Gally!

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:41.470
Can't you see my crescent-shaped mustache?

00:17:45.070 --> 00:17:48.520
To think that bug collector would be caught by a bunch of insects...

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:50.330
This is priceless!

00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:56.570
The greatest pirate on the seas stands before you!

00:17:56.570 --> 00:18:00.120
Your heads are too high!  Get down on your knees!

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:10.210
Silk!

00:18:15.180 --> 00:18:16.590
You still wanna fight?

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:20.340
Please stop!

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:22.180
Don't hurt her any more!

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:24.390
She started it!

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:32.360
We don't want to fight you.  Please take our money and provisions, then leave this town!

00:18:32.360 --> 00:18:33.690
I'm begging you!

00:18:35.120 --> 00:18:37.780
Why should I listen to what an insect asks me to do?!

00:18:49.720 --> 00:18:51.040
My treasure...

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:53.750
Did you say something?

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:56.460
<i>This town is my treasure!</i>

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:58.720
<i>I will protect it!</i>

00:19:02.050 --> 00:19:02.930
<i>Huh?!</i>

00:19:03.570 --> 00:19:05.900
What kind of nonsense is that?!

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:07.770
Silk!

00:19:09.810 --> 00:19:14.010
They're all so important to me, that I'll fight for them even if I'm alone!

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:19.570
That's why I won't let you have anything!

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:27.020
What are you, stupid?

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:29.700
This town is your "treasure"?

00:19:29.700 --> 00:19:31.440
Don't be ridiculous!

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:35.680
Treasure is shiny stuff like gold and jewels,

00:19:35.680 --> 00:19:39.300
and the power to survive this Great Age of Pirates.

00:19:40.180 --> 00:19:43.260
Things like the great pirate ship I'm sailing on!

00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:47.780
This town is a treasure?!

00:19:47.780 --> 00:19:50.660
That's just laughable!

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:52.600
Hey!  You guys laugh too!

00:19:54.550 --> 00:19:57.270
What a stupid girl!

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:10.270
<i>Don't laugh at Silk!</i>

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:14.550
Huh?!

00:20:14.550 --> 00:20:15.580
Mayor...

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:19.170
What do you know about her?!

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:21.710
Back when we were consumed by despair after having lost everything...

00:20:21.710 --> 00:20:25.860
If we hadn't have met her... If it hadn't been for her smile...

00:20:25.860 --> 00:20:28.100
we would have all died with the town!

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:32.560
The fact that this town still stands, and the fact that we're all still alive...

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:36.940
We owe it all to her, who gave us hope!

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:39.490
Someone like you, who can't do anything but plunder...

00:20:39.490 --> 00:20:43.860
laughing at our precious family... at Silk's feelings...

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:47.520
<i>We will never allow that!</i>

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:53.960
<i>Get out of here, you scum!</i>

00:20:56.490 --> 00:20:58.920
You don't know when to shut up, do you?!

00:20:59.970 --> 00:21:01.500
Keep your hands out of this!

00:21:02.220 --> 00:21:03.470
B-Boss?

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:11.510
Is that all you want to say?!

00:21:11.510 --> 00:21:12.850
Die!

00:21:12.850 --> 00:21:14.060
Weird mustache!

00:21:14.060 --> 00:21:15.780
Huh?!

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:21.750
<i>Boss!</i>

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:23.460
What was that?!

00:21:24.350 --> 00:21:25.780
Oh, Silk!

00:21:25.780 --> 00:21:27.660
His foot stretched!

00:21:29.940 --> 00:21:31.920
You damn rubber-bastard...

00:21:31.920 --> 00:21:33.830
Didn't I tell you to keep your hands out of this?!

00:21:34.610 --> 00:21:35.620
Foot.

00:21:36.870 --> 00:21:38.750
Oh, all right... <i>No, that's not what I meant!</i>

00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:40.250
You're not gonna run away this time?

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:43.920
I'm not gonna let you get away with this!

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:49.340
It doesn't hurt even if you punch me.
'Cause I'm made of rubber.

00:21:49.340 --> 00:21:51.700
You're becoming more annoying by the minute!

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:54.640
Wearing that ridiculous hat...

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.760
Oh my, what's this?  Your expression suddenly changed!  Now why is that?

00:22:00.310 --> 00:22:02.270
If you step on it, you'll pay!

00:22:02.270 --> 00:22:04.450
So you want me to step on it, huh?

00:22:04.450 --> 00:22:06.860
<i>Stop it!</i>

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:12.260
Take that!

00:22:12.260 --> 00:22:14.290
Move your foot!

00:22:14.290 --> 00:22:16.160
How's this?!

00:22:16.160 --> 00:22:21.290
There!  And there!  And there!

00:22:21.730 --> 00:22:23.170
This feels great!

00:22:31.550 --> 00:22:33.060
Stop it!

00:22:33.060 --> 00:22:37.520
This isn't something that a piece of trash like you can just trample for no reason!

00:22:37.520 --> 00:22:39.890
Get your filthy foot off of it!

00:22:41.220 --> 00:22:42.060
Silk...

00:22:42.060 --> 00:22:46.220
Who do you think you are, talking to the greatest pirate on the sea like that?!

00:22:46.220 --> 00:22:47.990
Give me that!

00:22:51.260 --> 00:22:53.830
Devil Fruit users can't swim, right?

00:22:54.830 --> 00:22:57.250
So how about this?!

00:23:00.530 --> 00:23:04.000
If it gets swept out to sea by the tides,
you'll never be able to find it again, right?!

00:23:04.000 --> 00:23:07.370
Oh what a shame, you puny little pirate-wannabe!

00:23:07.370 --> 00:23:09.470
<i>Damn you!</i>

00:23:09.800 --> 00:23:13.510
Someday, I'm gonna find One Piece...

00:23:13.510 --> 00:23:15.390
and become the Pirate King!

00:23:17.210 --> 00:23:19.350
So you're gonna surpass us, huh?

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:24.450
Then I'll give you this.
Make sure to return it to me someday...

00:23:24.450 --> 00:23:26.730
after you've become a great pirate.

00:23:26.730 --> 00:23:29.900
That's a promise, Luffy.

00:23:40.410 --> 00:23:41.520
Damn it...

00:23:45.880 --> 00:23:49.380
Carry the treasure onboard!  We're setting sail!

00:23:56.520 --> 00:23:59.390
Are we just gonna set sail like this, Boss?

00:23:59.390 --> 00:24:02.850
Of course not!  Let's teach 'em a lesson!

00:24:07.320 --> 00:24:09.990
Thanks... I owe you my life...

00:24:09.990 --> 00:24:11.070
Are you all right?

00:24:11.070 --> 00:24:13.030
Those guys...

00:24:13.030 --> 00:24:15.170
I won't let them get away!

00:24:15.170 --> 00:24:16.280
So that's them...

00:24:16.280 --> 00:24:19.240
It's impossible!  You'll never catch up!

00:24:20.090 --> 00:24:22.080
I understand that you can't forgive them...

00:24:22.080 --> 00:24:24.370
And you're just gonna give up?!

00:24:26.040 --> 00:24:29.840
Is that all your treasure's worth to you?

00:24:31.040 --> 00:24:32.970
Do you really think of it as precious?!

00:24:43.240 --> 00:24:45.870
If it's that hard on you, then don't forgive them!

00:24:45.870 --> 00:24:47.110
Never!

00:24:50.790 --> 00:24:53.080
You don't have to tell me...

00:24:54.740 --> 00:24:57.070
The truth is... The truth is...

00:24:57.070 --> 00:24:58.240
I can't take this!

00:24:59.760 --> 00:25:00.740
All right!

00:25:01.570 --> 00:25:05.000
In that case, I'll just send him flying while I'm at it!

00:25:15.430 --> 00:25:17.430
Keep firing!

00:25:42.740 --> 00:25:46.000
I can't smile... anymore...

00:25:50.540 --> 00:25:52.750
I couldn't protect anything...

00:25:54.630 --> 00:25:57.760
<i>Smile!</i>

00:25:58.910 --> 00:26:02.390
If you're crying then the rest of the townsfolk can't smile either, right?!

00:26:04.270 --> 00:26:05.350
Luffy...

00:26:21.900 --> 00:26:23.950
Right, this'll do.

00:26:31.880 --> 00:26:34.170
Boss!  He's flying right at us!

00:26:34.170 --> 00:26:36.430
<i>What?!</i>

00:26:36.430 --> 00:26:37.920
Oh, of course.  Shoot him down!

00:26:39.470 --> 00:26:40.550
Hold on!

00:26:48.890 --> 00:26:50.860
Take that!

00:26:52.900 --> 00:26:54.570
Straw Hat!

00:26:55.770 --> 00:26:57.650
Sunny!  You guys!

00:27:00.450 --> 00:27:02.570
<i>A flying ship?!</i>

00:27:07.130 --> 00:27:08.570
Hey, guys!  Long time no-

00:27:08.570 --> 00:27:09.620
<i>There!</i>

00:27:09.620 --> 00:27:11.750
What have you been doing the whole time you were gone?!

00:27:11.750 --> 00:27:15.920
I got caught up in an ocean current and tried to fish up a Sea King.

00:27:15.920 --> 00:27:17.210
And then it tried to eat me!

00:27:17.210 --> 00:27:22.590
And you ended up not knowing where the Sunny was, and couldn't come back, right?

00:27:22.590 --> 00:27:25.600
Still, I'm impressed you managed to figure out where I was.

00:27:25.600 --> 00:27:27.260
You can thank Chopper's nose.

00:27:27.260 --> 00:27:28.460
I see!

00:27:28.460 --> 00:27:34.570
Luffy!  Because you ate all the food in the refrigerator in one go, we...

00:27:34.570 --> 00:27:38.480
He did it while a certain idiot was too busy shouting "mellorine", right?

00:27:38.940 --> 00:27:42.470
What a magnificent way of eating, though.  Perhaps next time, I should try it too...

00:27:42.470 --> 00:27:43.280
<i>Back off!</i>

00:27:43.280 --> 00:27:44.870
So harsh!

00:27:44.870 --> 00:27:49.570
We shouldn't have sent stupid Luffy out to do the shopping, even if it was as punishment!

00:27:49.570 --> 00:27:51.120
Did you get any food?!

00:27:51.120 --> 00:27:51.960
I forgot.

00:27:52.720 --> 00:27:54.830
I was a fool for trusting him...

00:27:54.830 --> 00:28:00.150
We couldn't even move until you got back, and we were on the verge of starvation!

00:28:00.150 --> 00:28:02.630
Y-You're surprisingly lively, though...

00:28:04.170 --> 00:28:05.340
I'b sowwy...

00:28:05.340 --> 00:28:08.260
So, what's with that pirate ship?

00:28:08.260 --> 00:28:09.720
Oh, just a little fight.

00:28:09.720 --> 00:28:12.340
You got yourself into trouble <i>again?</i>

00:28:12.340 --> 00:28:15.200
If you're too exhausted, then you can sit this one out, you damn moss-head.

00:28:15.200 --> 00:28:19.640
Huh?!  Want me to cut you to shreds before those guys?!

00:28:19.640 --> 00:28:21.620
Sure, why don't you try?!

00:28:21.620 --> 00:28:22.730
Now, calm down, you two...

00:28:23.150 --> 00:28:24.320
Blast them to smithereens!

00:28:28.700 --> 00:28:30.830
Leave this to me!

00:28:30.830 --> 00:28:31.910
Rumble!

00:28:39.450 --> 00:28:40.710
<i>That's absurd!</i>

00:28:44.510 --> 00:28:45.640
<i>Chopper!</i>

00:28:46.120 --> 00:28:48.320
You handle the rest...

00:28:52.930 --> 00:28:54.440
Attack!

00:29:03.070 --> 00:29:04.990
Strong Right!

00:29:07.660 --> 00:29:08.820
Clutch!

00:29:16.750 --> 00:29:19.750
D-Don't tell me, these guys are...

00:29:23.830 --> 00:29:25.170
Clutch!

00:29:29.950 --> 00:29:31.180
Fly off.

00:29:31.180 --> 00:29:34.390
H-How can these guys be so strong?!

00:29:37.530 --> 00:29:39.400
I'm gonna send you flying!

00:29:40.190 --> 00:29:41.850
Boss, look at this!

00:29:42.730 --> 00:29:43.780
<i>What?!</i>

00:29:44.740 --> 00:29:49.540
He's Monkey D. Luffy?!
The man with a 300 million beli bounty?!

00:29:49.540 --> 00:29:52.690
A-And mine's just five million... <i>Are you kidding me?!</i>

00:29:52.690 --> 00:29:54.750
<i>We're so sorry!</i>

00:29:54.750 --> 00:29:56.540
<i>What are you guys doing?!</i>

00:29:57.050 --> 00:30:00.720
Luffy!  We've taken all their treasure and food!

00:30:00.720 --> 00:30:02.460
Now you can do whatever you want with them!

00:30:02.460 --> 00:30:06.170
Gally.  I'm gonna trample your treasure and sink it too.

00:30:06.170 --> 00:30:08.930
D-D-Don't be ridiculous!

00:30:08.930 --> 00:30:09.750
You seriously think you can do that?!

00:30:10.570 --> 00:30:11.220
I can.

00:30:12.920 --> 00:30:14.890
Don't mess with me!

00:30:15.060 --> 00:30:15.980
Die!

00:30:19.150 --> 00:30:21.860
Now, get moving!  We're getting out of here!

00:30:23.530 --> 00:30:24.610
What was that?!

00:30:24.610 --> 00:30:27.390
T-The rudder's been broken!  We can't move!

00:30:27.390 --> 00:30:28.570
<i>What?!</i>

00:30:29.660 --> 00:30:33.080
Don't forget about me, now!

00:30:33.080 --> 00:30:34.740
<i>You were the first to run away!</i>

00:30:34.740 --> 00:30:37.200
Go, Luffy!

00:30:37.200 --> 00:30:39.370
Gum Gum...

00:30:40.380 --> 00:30:43.000
Bone Balloon!

00:30:46.710 --> 00:30:47.780
What?!

00:30:50.030 --> 00:30:55.140
Gigant Axe!

00:31:21.000 --> 00:31:25.760
I will kill you someday!
Remember that, Straw Hat Luffy!

00:31:25.760 --> 00:31:26.420
Whatever!

00:31:34.100 --> 00:31:35.260
<i>And this...</i>

00:31:35.260 --> 00:31:38.890
<i>is for Silk!</i>

00:31:51.070 --> 00:31:55.750
Amazing!  There's twice as much treasure here as they stole from us!

00:31:55.750 --> 00:31:59.230
Who was that man with the straw hat, anyway?

00:31:59.230 --> 00:32:01.040
He said he was a pirate, but...

00:32:03.750 --> 00:32:04.500
Luffy...

00:32:05.830 --> 00:32:08.600
I sure hope you can find One Piece.

00:32:12.000 --> 00:32:22.290
1-10-100 Thousand!

00:32:31.750 --> 00:32:35.860
The tears of parting and the joys of meeting,

00:32:35.860 --> 00:32:39.550
we'll link them together, like the pass of a baton.

00:32:40.060 --> 00:32:46.990
Our journey goes on, with new friends.

00:32:48.000 --> 00:32:52.270
The things you can do and the things I'm best at.

00:32:52.270 --> 00:32:55.980
If we can bring them together like a party,

00:32:56.440 --> 00:33:03.230
we'll write a new line in the history of the world with each passing day!

00:33:04.980 --> 00:33:07.380
Flying, the ship is flying,

00:33:07.380 --> 00:33:09.170
(It's completely unprecedented, nobody's heard of such a thing
Flying, the ship is flying,

00:33:09.170 --> 00:33:10.470
yet thinking about it like that, it sounds nice!)
Flying, the ship is flying,

00:33:10.470 --> 00:33:11.210
yet thinking about it like that, it sounds nice!)

00:33:11.210 --> 00:33:15.610
Catching the wind and soaring,

00:33:15.610 --> 00:33:21.740
we'll have the blue sky to ourselves, so come along!

00:33:22.220 --> 00:33:27.640
1-10-100 Thousand Sunny, fly high!

00:33:27.640 --> 00:33:32.020
Carry on the spirit of that brave ship.

00:33:32.020 --> 00:33:35.290
We'll get it on right away with our brand new ship!

00:33:35.290 --> 00:33:37.320
Overcoming the storms,

00:33:37.320 --> 00:33:40.220
and crossing a thousand seas.

00:33:40.220 --> 00:33:44.040
Continuing to the end of an endless dream and beyond...

00:33:44.040 --> 00:33:50.570
Soar! Fly high, Thousand Sunny!

00:33:50.720 --> 00:33:52.300
Fly high!
